{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50998","headline":"赠赵叟（题拟） · 何蒙","name":"赠赵叟（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂枝轮却正凄然，又被鸎声聒昼眠。\n唯有赵翁知仔细，相传好语待来年。\n（见《江南余载》卷上。\n）（〖1〗《江南余载》：赵叟者，自保大之初至於开宝之季，尝爲贡院门子，每岁放榜之後，或去或留，率庆慰之，若出於叟手然。\n进士何蒙目前叟诗曰〖诗不重录〗云云。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}